# Local tooling / analysis — must never be published (GitHub Pages serves everything in main)
claude-seo/

# Camera originals. GitHub Pages serves everything in main, and these carry the
# EXIF the published copies do not — GPS coordinates and the device model. Keep
# them here to work from; the WebP files in images/ and images/r/ are what ships.
images/*.JPG
images/*.HEIC
images/IMG_*

# Draft legal text awaiting review. Deliberately not committed: GitHub Pages
